<title>HONG KONG: Frankie Dominion H1 net down 63.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Frankie Dominion H1 net down 63.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   1.9    vs 5.4</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.0    vs 3.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs 7.14 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    6.16   vs 16.90</p>
<p>    Turnover		     457.74 vs 520.86</p>
<p>    Company name		 Frankie Dominion International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 14-18</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 31</p>
<p>NOTE - Frankie Dominion is a household products maker.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
